  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Blood wight stands with asura zombie, heavenly demon zombie, nightmare zombie, and plague zombie as the five great flying zombies.",
        "chapters": [
          185
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The same five are the five great flying zombie Gu in the world, the rank five flying zombie Gu of the classic zombie series of transformation path.",
        "chapters": [
          526
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan finds a thought from Mo Yao’s will: a killer move that uses borrow strength Gu as the core, six types of flying zombie Gu as the supplement, and another thirty-six Gu worms, built from his four arm wind king after he found borrow strength Gu. He already knows the five great flying zombie Gu and asks what the sixth is.",
        "chapters": [
          569
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_mo_yao",
          "gu_borrow_strength_gu",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Mo Yao’s will names earth chief zombie Gu. Ordinary earth chief zombie Gu is rank five like those five, but cannot fly. Her modified recipe lets an earth chief zombie soar on the natural magnetic field without wings.",
        "chapters": [
          570
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "sixth-member",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_earth_chief_zombie_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A genuine six arm heavenly zombie king uses borrow strength Gu as the core and the six great flying zombie Gu as the backbone, with many other Gu as support. When Fang Yuan issues a downgraded reward version through Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, the core becomes overlord Gu, the other flying zombie Gu stay unchanged, and old earth chief zombie Gu replaces Mo Yao’s modified Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          579
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "reward-version",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
          "gu_old_earth_chief_zombie_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In immortal zombie form Fang Yuan is six meters tall with eight arms. Besides his two human arms, the other six come from asura zombie Gu, heavenly demon zombie Gu, blood wight Gu, nightmare zombie Gu, plague zombie Gu, and earth chief zombie Gu, named together as the other rank five flying zombie Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          650
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "six-extra-arms",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_asura_zombie_gu",
          "gu_blood_wight_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
